Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Trap Cop Reset : Print #1,Errtrap
Trap Cop Move $180,$F00 : Print #1,Errtrap
Copper Off
L1=Cop Logic : Cop Reset
Cop Move $180,$F00 : Cop Wait 0,100 : Cop Move $180,$0F0 : Cop Movel $120,$12345678
Cop Wait 100,260 : Cop Move $180,$00F : Cop Wait 200,270,$7E,$7F : Cop Wait 312,312
A$="" : For I=0 To 12 : A$=A$+Hex$(Deek(L1+I*2))+" " : Next I : Print #1,A$
Trap Cop Move 512,0 : Print #1,Errtrap
Trap Cop Wait 313,0 : Print #1,Errtrap
Trap Cop Wait 0,313 : Print #1,Errtrap
Cop Move $1FF,$1234 : Print #1,Hex$(Deek(L1+26));" ";Hex$(Deek(L1+28))
Cop Swap : L2=Cop Logic : Print #1,L1<>L2
Print #1,Hex$(Leek(L1+30))
Cop Reset : Cop Move $180,$FFF : Print #1,Hex$(Deek(L2));" ";Hex$(Deek(L2+2))
Cop Swap : Print #1,Cop Logic=L1
N=0 : Repeat : Trap Cop Move $180,N : E=Errtrap : Inc N : Until E<>0 or N>20000 : Print #1,E;N>100
Cop Reset : Cop Wait 0,10 : Cop Swap
Copper On : Wait Vbl : Print #1,"end"
